{"2953480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lunar Eclipse", "steam_appid": 2953480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/4cb7669766802733871b3c69dc330f63.poster.avif?t=1783972273\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/4cb7669766802733871b3c69dc330f63.webm?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/4cb7669766802733871b3c69dc330f63.mp4?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore atmospheric, detailed locations and enjoy realistic graphics with a carefully crafted environment. Overcome obstacles, climb over barriers, crawl through tight spaces, and scale heights - only the most determined will find their way forward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/ca16a397ac27b5dc8af3d8a5ff9ebfff.poster.avif?t=1783972273\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/ca16a397ac27b5dc8af3d8a5ff9ebfff.webm?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/ca16a397ac27b5dc8af3d8a5ff9ebfff.mp4?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter various puzzles along your path, solving which will be the key to understanding the true nature of these events.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/a93abcc09401b3488b15ded347077737.poster.avif?t=1783972273\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/a93abcc09401b3488b15ded347077737.webm?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/a93abcc09401b3488b15ded347077737.mp4?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a fragile girl and feel the silence of the dark corridors. Explore the shadowy locations hidden around every corner of this once-familiar place.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/c1feaadebd33eb82c1e3816c6216bb97.poster.avif?t=1783972273\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/c1feaadebd33eb82c1e3816c6216bb97.webm?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/c1feaadebd33eb82c1e3816c6216bb97.mp4?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You open your eyes - it's a familiar ceiling, but something feels off. The silence is too deep. The place that was your home since childhood now feels empty, lifeless... almost unfamiliar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Where is everyone? Why did they leave you behind?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find the answers, you’ll have to move forward - through the unsettling darkness, through abandoned hallways hiding unknown dangers. But you won’t give up. Because you have a purpose. And if the world has truly fallen… then someone has to save it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/050fb73f7a4e29bc7ddf63a4ddaf5386.poster.avif?t=1783972273\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/050fb73f7a4e29bc7ddf63a4ddaf5386.webm?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/050fb73f7a4e29bc7ddf63a4ddaf5386.mp4?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique close-combat system has been designed to make every encounter intense and dangerous. Even the simplest zombies are now formidable threats. With only a kitchen knife as your main weapon, combat takes place at a dangerously close distance. Experience a classic combat system where every move matters.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/4cb7669766802733871b3c69dc330f63.poster.avif?t=1783972273\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/4cb7669766802733871b3c69dc330f63.webm?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953480/extras/4cb7669766802733871b3c69dc330f63.mp4?t=1783972273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p 